	)
	(text "U4 units 10-12: GPIO_EMC, MIPI, USB PHYs\n\n- SEMC x16 SDRAM bus\n- USB1 (OTG1) to USB-C, USB2 to Coral\n- TPU control GPIO, LPUART6 console\n- MIPI CSI / DSI (camera, no connector)"
