	(text "U4 units 2-6: power, clock, GPIO_LPSR\n\n- Core, LPSR, 1P0 and ADC supplies\n- Internal DCDC, 10 mOhm sense resistors\n- VSS balls\n- 24 MHz crystal (Y2), DAC_OUT\n- GPIO_LPSR: SWD, LPSPI6, I2C5, BOOT_MODE"
