	(text_box "These labels appear once in the whole design. They are carry-overs from the Dev Board Micro reference (B2B connector, Wi-Fi, mic, crypto) and connect to nothing else.\np.5: CRYPTO_RST_N, DAC_OUT, DMIC_DATA0, MIC_CLK, I2C6_SCL, I2C6_SDA\np.6: ADC1_CH0B, ADC1_CH2B, BT_REG_ON, WL_REG_ON, FLEXPWM1_PWM0_A/B, FLEXPWM1_PWM1_B, FLEXPWM2_PWM1_A/B, I2C1_SCL/SDA, LPSPI1_*, LPUART1_TXD/RXD, USB_PORT_RT.\n\nThese may be deleted in the future."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
